# Build context hygiene for the official engine image.
# Required for `cargo build --bin omakure`: Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/
#
# `tests/` is deliberately IN the context: the `harness` stage compiles the
# Health Plane attempt-exhaustion harness from it. The `runtime` stage never
# copies it, so the shipped image is unchanged.
#
# Note that the patterns below are context-root-scoped, so they do not filter
# anything under `tests/` -- a `tests/*.log` or `tests/**/.env` would reach the
# build context. Nothing of the sort exists today; keep it that way.

target/
.git/
.github/
.temp/
docs/
.claude/
.cursor/
.opencode/
release-notes/
scripts/
*.log
*.tmp
tarpaulin-report.html
cobertura.xml
.env
.env.*
compose.yaml
.dockerignore
*.md
